{"id": null, "n": "1065010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1065010", "type": "orig", "text": "法＋（一卷七）【宋】【宮】，（一卷）【元】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1065011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1065011", "type": "orig", "text": "（劉）＋宋【元】【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1065012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1065012", "type": "orig", "text": "罽賓三藏＝元嘉年【聖】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1065013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1065013", "type": "orig", "text": "（其諸…異）二十字＝（凡諸羯磨作法應先唱言）十字【三】【宮】，此夾註次行宋元明宮四本俱有不來乃至持千七百六十九字附卷末 cf. P. 1071."}
{"id": null, "n": "1065014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1065014", "type": "orig", "text": "法＝一【聖】"}
{"id": null, "n": "1065015", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_1065015", "type": "orig", "text": "白＋（言）【三】【宮】"}
